<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>因果推断 on QiView</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/tags/%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E6%8E%A8%E6%96%AD/</link><description>Recent content in 因果推断 on QiView</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/tags/%E5%9B%A0%E6%9E%9C%E6%8E%A8%E6%96%AD/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>双重差分法：平行趋势、异质性处理效应与交错DID</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/difference-in-differences/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/difference-in-differences/</guid><description>从经典2×2 DID出发，推导双向固定效应（TWFE）的识别条件，详解平行趋势假设的检验与强化策略，并系统介绍交错采纳设计下异质处理效应的新近文献（Callaway-Sant&amp;rsquo;Anna, Sun-Abraham）。</description></item><item><title>因果推断的潜在结果框架：Rubin因果模型与干预效应估计</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/potential-outcomes-framework/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/potential-outcomes-framework/</guid><description>系统阐述Rubin潜在结果因果模型（POF）的核心概念，包括因果推断的基本问题、SUTVA假设、ATE/ATT/LATE等处理效应概念，以及随机化实验如何从根本上解决选择偏差问题。</description></item><item><title>工具变量法：局部平均处理效应、两阶段最小二乘与弱工具变量</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/instrumental-variables-2sls/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/instrumental-variables-2sls/</guid><description>系统建立工具变量（IV/2SLS）识别框架，从Angrist-Imbens的单调性假设出发推导LATE的解释，讨论弱工具变量问题的诊断与解决，以及多工具变量的过度识别检验。</description></item><item><title>断点回归设计：局部随机化、带宽选择与有效性检验</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/regression-discontinuity-design/</link><pubDate>Fri, 13 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/regression-discontinuity-design/</guid><description>系统介绍断点回归设计（RDD）的识别逻辑与估计策略，涵盖Sharp RDD与Fuzzy RDD的形式化框架，局部多项式估计器、最优带宽选择（CCT方法），以及操纵检验、协变量平衡等有效性检验。</description></item><item><title>计量经济学：DID 与事件研究法（Python）</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/econometrics/2026-01-03-%E8%AE%A1%E9%87%8F%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E5%AD%A6-did%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%B3%95-python/</link><pubDate>Sat, 03 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/econometrics/2026-01-03-%E8%AE%A1%E9%87%8F%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E5%AD%A6-did%E4%B8%8E%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%B3%95-python/</guid><description>从平行趋势假设出发，给出 DID 与事件研究法的建模、可视化与稳健性检查流程。</description></item><item><title>多学科知识资源库</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/library/knowledge_websites/knowledge_resources/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/library/knowledge_websites/knowledge_resources/</guid><description>针对大语言模型、机器学习、因果推断、博弈论、网络分析的多学科知识资源、工具和平台导航</description></item><item><title>计量经济学</title><link>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/econometrics/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://SurpriseQiD.github.io/knowledge/machine-learning-causal-inference/econometrics/</guid><description>系统记录《高级计量经济学》核心概念、推导过程与实践应用</description></item></channel></rss>